    "created_at": "2016-11-07T22:23:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-07T22:23:57Z",
    "body": "I'm happy to keep working on this, but it's a little discouraging because it seems like it's just a quagmire of underspecified and undertested behavior that keeps getting worse the more we dig into it, necessitating more tests being written and more spec text that we're unsure about, all for somewhat minimal gain. So I guess it is lower priority for me and I might have trouble getting it over the finish line.\n",
