    "created_at": "2016-11-08T00:14:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-08T00:14:48Z",
    "body": "I agree about the underspecified/undertested morass here.  I'm just being a bit worried about specifying something that is not web-compatible...\n\nI'll respond to the substance of https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1995#discussion_r86883411 when I have had a bit more time to think about it, tomorrow.  I also plan to carefully look through the tests in https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/4089 then.\n\nI totally understand it if you're not terribly motivated to keep pushing on this one; I wonder whether we can get someone to pick up writing some tests around this stuff, at least, so we'd have an idea of what current UAs do.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
