    "updated_at": "2025-09-03T07:38:54Z",
    "body": "Closing as I won't have time to work on this. See some discussion in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11618 and https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/4089#issuecomment-3248026536; I think event handler IDL compilation is still a bit broken here. I'm not sure there are other cases where we can reach the \"report an exception\" algorithm though.",
